# Party & raid frame engine (folded in from HealForever/TankForever).
# Its own private namespace (FUI.Frames); settings live INSIDE the ForeverUI
# profile (one save per character for the whole addon, healer + tank + DPS).
# It boots as a ForeverUI module (Integration.lua), after the profile is chosen.
